1. A peer-reviewed study (with DOI link) comparing thermal retention efficacy of synthetic vs. down insulation in sub-zero urban commutes across ≥12 countries, published 2020–2024;  
2. Full methodology critique — specifically whether wind-chill simulation accounted for micro-turbulence around hood drawcords;  
3. Confirmation of whether you personally own a cat — and if so, its breed, age, and preferred sleeping posture relative to radiators.  

